WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Every day, the messages, files and notifications keep coming.

2
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:14.800
We went from search engines that list links, to chat that gives answers, to assistants that help finish the work.

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:21.000
Information becomes results: a report, a spreadsheet, a deck.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:40.000
This is the AI revolution. And it is a work revolution.

